      ],
      "source": "https://pariskytourism.com/see-do/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Bourbon County Courthouse, finished in 1905, is often called the grandest of Kentucky’s county courthouses and was designed as a Frankfort capitol proposal.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://pariskytourism.com/see-do/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ruffian, the undefeated racehorse, was born at Claiborne Farm in Paris, Kentucky, and remains one of racing’s most dominant fillies.",
